<B>Parameters of this class are:</B><BR><BR>
<table class="doxtable" border="1" width="100%" cellpadding="4">
<tr><th>Name</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Restrictions</th><th>Description</th></tr>
<tr>
  <td style="vertical-align:top"><b>frame_length</b></td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">int</td><td style="vertical-align:top">11</td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">&nbsp;</td><td style="vertical-align:top">The number of subsequent data points used for smoothing.<BR>This number has to be uneven. If it is not, 1 will be added.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="vertical-align:top"><b>polynomial_order</b></td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">int</td><td style="vertical-align:top">4</td>
  <td style="vertical-align:top">&nbsp;</td><td style="vertical-align:top">Order or the polynomial that is fitted.</td>
</tr>
</table>
<br>
